    <li><a href="/docs/governance">Governance</a> - deprecation, audit trail, and compliance reporting</li>
    <li><a href="/docs/trust-tiers">Trust Tiers</a> - how skill trust is evaluated</li>
  </ul>
</DocsLayout>
